WEBVTT

01:38.600 --> 01:41.480
BASED ON THE NOVEL
"THE PRISONER OF BEAUTY" BY PENGLAI KE

01:45.280 --> 01:47.200
QIAO GUI PASSED AWAY PEACEFULLY
ON APRIL 13TH, AGED 60.

01:48.600 --> 01:51.160
I missed my chance
to see him one last time.

01:52.080 --> 01:54.560
My lady, I'll go pack our things now.

01:54.920 --> 01:58.320
Let's return to Kangjun at once
to fulfill your wish.

01:58.400 --> 01:59.200
I'm on it.

01:59.280 --> 02:00.360
No.

02:03.800 --> 02:05.360
Our greater plan isn't complete.

02:07.320 --> 02:09.160
I must not go back.

03:12.480 --> 03:14.800
QIAO GUI PASSED AWAY PEACEFULLY
ON APRIL 13TH, AGED 60.

03:16.000 --> 03:17.280
That old perp.

03:18.240 --> 03:19.720
His death was well-deserved.

03:26.200 --> 03:27.040
My lord,

03:27.640 --> 03:30.400
I'll dig up that Qiao betrayer
and flog his corpse!

03:31.160 --> 03:33.680
That slippery betrayer escaped us.

03:33.760 --> 03:35.960
Now, even when we take Yanzhou,
we will never get to see him fall!

03:36.040 --> 03:39.040
Generals, don't dwell on hatred.

03:39.120 --> 03:42.040
See the bigger picture and act flexibly.

03:42.120 --> 03:43.560
Then, Mr. Gongsun, tell us,

03:43.640 --> 03:45.640
why would they send an obituary now?

03:45.720 --> 03:48.520
The marriage will be canceled
due to filial mourning.

03:48.600 --> 03:50.400
Our claim to Panyi and the canal project

03:50.480 --> 03:51.760
will both be delayed!

03:51.840 --> 03:53.880
What scheme is the Qiao clan plotting now?

03:56.720 --> 03:58.200
Does Lady Qiao know of this?

04:00.480 --> 04:01.440
My lord,

04:02.080 --> 04:03.520
Zhang Pu didn't mention it.

04:06.400 --> 04:07.880
Sorry I'm late.

04:09.240 --> 04:10.320
It's fine.

04:11.400 --> 04:13.720
I assume you've read the letter.

04:16.560 --> 04:19.240
Everyone said
this marriage would never happen,

04:20.120 --> 04:21.720
but I only have one question.

04:22.640 --> 04:23.840
Will you marry me or not?

04:29.480 --> 04:32.600
I know what your family is planning,

04:33.600 --> 04:36.960
but they don't know our plans.

04:42.720 --> 04:44.120
This marriage

04:44.840 --> 04:46.720
was Grandfather's dying wish.

04:47.680 --> 04:49.880
I don't think
he'd blame me for proceeding.

05:11.440 --> 05:14.240
SPIRIT TABLET OF THE LATE LORD WEI JING

05:51.880 --> 05:53.040
Is Miss Xiaoqiao asleep?

06:13.200 --> 06:14.400
What is this?

06:16.480 --> 06:17.800
A lynx.

06:57.720 --> 07:00.200
SPIRIT TABLET OF THE LATE LORD QIAO GUI

07:31.680 --> 07:33.880
A man's mind is truly unfathomable.

07:34.600 --> 07:38.040
Days ago he dodged marriage talks,
avoiding the match.

07:38.120 --> 07:41.320
Now, suddenly,
he won't wait another moment.

07:43.080 --> 07:45.600
You wouldn't blame me, right?

08:38.120 --> 08:39.760
Here comes the bride.

08:48.080 --> 08:51.040
SPIRIT TABLET OF THE LATE LORD WEI JING

08:51.120 --> 08:51.880
Shao.

08:51.960 --> 08:53.160
LATE LORD WEI LUN

08:53.240 --> 08:54.840
You have to shoulder responsibilities now.

08:54.920 --> 08:56.400
LATE BROTHER WEI BAO

08:56.480 --> 08:58.240
You carry the hopes of the Wei family.

09:09.960 --> 09:10.720
My lord.

10:14.120 --> 10:15.560
Lower the fan.

10:33.120 --> 10:34.840
Cleanse your hands.

10:40.280 --> 10:41.840
Share the ritual meal.

10:44.080 --> 10:46.240
Eat the millet.

10:56.560 --> 10:57.760
Drink the broth.

11:21.640 --> 11:22.720
Taste the sauce.

11:36.640 --> 11:38.720
Drink from the nuptial cups.

11:54.600 --> 11:56.880
SPIRIT TABLETS:
WEI BAO, WEI LUN, WEI JING

12:18.480 --> 12:20.480
The rites are completed.

12:43.960 --> 12:47.040
That Qiao traitor died too easily.

12:50.240 --> 12:53.360
But today is our lord's wedding day.

12:54.560 --> 12:55.600
Right.

12:55.680 --> 12:57.240
Today's a joyous occasion.

12:57.320 --> 12:58.680
No more dark thoughts.

12:58.760 --> 13:00.240
Come on, drink!

13:00.840 --> 13:01.800
Let's toast!

13:02.440 --> 13:03.760
Here, drink up!

13:04.440 --> 13:05.920
- Come on, drink!
- Cheers!

13:07.880 --> 13:09.200
Let's toast!

13:10.080 --> 13:12.200
- Drink.
- Cheers!

13:28.560 --> 13:29.560
Lord Wei.

13:38.600 --> 13:40.040
From today onward,

13:40.560 --> 13:42.200
I shall call you, "My lord."

13:47.440 --> 13:49.000
You can take those off.

13:50.080 --> 13:51.120
You must be tired.

13:51.600 --> 13:52.680
Rest early.

14:01.400 --> 14:02.760
From this day on,

14:03.560 --> 14:04.680
we are husband and wife.

14:06.040 --> 14:09.240
No matter what I do to the Qiao clan,

14:09.720 --> 14:11.120
or to Yanzhou,

14:13.760 --> 14:15.080
I will never harm you.

14:15.840 --> 14:17.560
Nor will I leave you homeless.

14:21.320 --> 14:22.400
Thank you, my lord.

14:23.960 --> 14:25.800
But I have one condition.

14:29.000 --> 14:30.200
From now on,

14:31.160 --> 14:32.960
you are a Wei,

14:33.840 --> 14:35.240
not a Qiao.

15:32.360 --> 15:34.400
- Bottoms up!
- Come on, finish it.

15:42.440 --> 15:44.920
SPIRIT TABLETS
WEI BAO, WEI LUN, WEI JING

15:55.840 --> 15:59.040
SPIRIT TABLETS
WEI BAO, WEI LUN, WEI JING

16:02.320 --> 16:07.120
SPIRIT TABLET OF THE LATE LORD QIAO GUI

16:07.200 --> 16:09.880
The marriage is now sealed,
and the covenant set.

16:09.960 --> 16:12.040
Since His Lordship has made his vow,

16:12.120 --> 16:15.480
you can rest assured as his bride.

16:16.400 --> 16:17.760
He's not a bad man.

16:19.240 --> 16:20.800
But I'll always be a Qiao,

16:21.560 --> 16:23.160
always putting the Qiao clan first.

16:23.800 --> 16:25.440
That cannot be changed.

16:25.520 --> 16:26.640
LATE LORD QIAO GUI

16:26.720 --> 16:28.800
Look upon it well, my lady.

16:28.880 --> 16:29.760
In a few days,

16:29.840 --> 16:32.400
we'll depart for Yujun
with the Lord of Wei.

16:33.000 --> 16:34.840
Once we cross into Wei territory,

16:34.920 --> 16:37.320
we can no longer honor Lord Qiao's tablet.

16:43.760 --> 16:46.480
SPIRIT TABLET OF THE LATE LORD QIAO GUI

18:05.280 --> 18:06.440
Are you cold, my lady?

18:06.520 --> 18:07.840
I'll fetch hot water.

18:07.920 --> 18:09.040
Mother, take this.

18:09.120 --> 18:10.440
- But you need it.
- I'm fine.

18:10.520 --> 18:11.920
Xiaotao, hold the umbrella.

18:12.400 --> 18:13.480
Oh, this child…

18:15.640 --> 18:17.920
My lady, we're traveling overnight,

18:18.000 --> 18:21.000
and since you're not healed,
it might slow your recovery.

18:21.720 --> 18:23.120
The soldiers have been away so long.

18:23.200 --> 18:25.400
It's reasonable
that they're eager to return.

18:26.120 --> 18:28.080
We'll rest properly once we reach Yujun.

18:29.080 --> 18:31.760
We don't yet know what awaits us in Yujun.

18:31.840 --> 18:33.160
Let's get in now.

18:33.240 --> 18:35.760
This journey has been full of
snakes and earthworms,

18:35.840 --> 18:37.760
a sign of heavy rain within two days.

18:37.840 --> 18:39.200
The road ahead is marshy.

18:39.280 --> 18:41.960
Traveling after rainfall
will be far too dangerous.

18:42.040 --> 18:44.760
Our siege on Panyi has delayed us by days.

18:44.840 --> 18:46.160
If there are any further delays,

18:47.120 --> 18:48.680
I'll miss the memorial rites
for my family.

18:48.760 --> 18:49.720
All right.

18:49.800 --> 18:51.400
I'll give the orders.

18:51.480 --> 18:52.400
My lord,

18:53.560 --> 18:55.920
traveling overnight is no problem for us,

18:57.520 --> 18:58.760
but your wife is injured.

19:01.480 --> 19:03.560
Should we press on, or wait for her?

19:07.920 --> 19:09.040
Keep moving.

19:13.280 --> 19:14.800
Soldiers, prepare to depart!

19:14.880 --> 19:15.920
Yes!

19:18.280 --> 19:19.200
Hey.

19:21.360 --> 19:22.560
What now?

19:23.240 --> 19:24.200
Hold this.

19:29.600 --> 19:32.040
- Thank you, General Wei.
- Hold on.

19:32.120 --> 19:34.720
I saved your life back in Panyi,

19:35.280 --> 19:36.760
and this is your attitude?

19:37.760 --> 19:39.120
What's wrong with it?

19:41.240 --> 19:43.560
His Lordship already told my lady
that they are even,

19:43.640 --> 19:47.000
yet you act like
I still owe you something.

19:48.200 --> 19:50.520
They have made peace.

19:50.600 --> 19:53.200
You're the only one still snapping at me.

19:58.680 --> 19:59.920
Am I?

20:00.320 --> 20:01.400
No.

20:01.920 --> 20:03.040
Wait.

20:03.760 --> 20:05.800
My lord has ordered us to keep traveling.

20:05.880 --> 20:07.640
Fetching water wastes time.

20:08.440 --> 20:09.960
Are you serious?

20:10.040 --> 20:11.920
It's freezing. We just wanted hot water.

20:12.600 --> 20:13.560
The memorial rites

20:13.640 --> 20:17.720
for His Lordship's grandfather, father,
and brother are in a few days.

20:17.800 --> 20:20.800
Would delaying the trip for your water
be appropriate?

20:20.880 --> 20:22.760
How long could fetching water take?

20:22.840 --> 20:23.800
Too long.

20:23.880 --> 20:25.000
- Picking a fight?
- Tao.

20:26.000 --> 20:27.080
Let's set off.

20:27.160 --> 20:27.920
All right.

20:28.000 --> 20:29.360
Do you hear that?

20:29.440 --> 20:30.480
No water.

20:45.200 --> 20:49.000
YUJUN, WEI STATE

20:51.440 --> 20:54.240
His Lordship has returned!

20:54.320 --> 20:57.240
His Lordship has returned!

20:58.240 --> 21:01.160
His Lordship has returned!

21:02.680 --> 21:05.400
His Lordship has returned!

21:06.720 --> 21:09.760
His Lordship has returned!

21:10.400 --> 21:11.200
WEI

21:11.280 --> 21:13.880
His Lordship has returned!

21:16.080 --> 21:19.080
His Lordship has returned!

21:19.480 --> 21:20.440
Shao.

21:20.520 --> 21:21.360
Chuyu.

21:21.440 --> 21:22.320
For the past half month…

21:22.400 --> 21:23.320
ZHENG CHUYU
WEI SHAO'S COUSIN

21:23.400 --> 21:25.240
…I've waited here for you every day.

21:25.320 --> 21:27.200
I'm glad you're back.

21:27.280 --> 21:28.920
Have all the clan members arrived?

21:29.000 --> 21:31.920
All the uncles
and the regional prefects are here

21:32.000 --> 21:33.160
except for General Wei Dian.

21:33.240 --> 21:34.520
He's still on the road.

21:35.680 --> 21:37.360
We made it coming all the way from Panyi.

21:37.440 --> 21:38.520
Couldn't he make it from Hanjun?

21:38.600 --> 21:39.840
He's doing this on purpose.

21:41.240 --> 21:44.240
Wasn't Lady Qiao
supposed to enter the city with you?

21:45.200 --> 21:47.240
I left her outside the city.

21:47.320 --> 21:49.200
But after the memorial rites,

21:49.280 --> 21:51.160
I'll trouble you to bring her in.

21:53.920 --> 21:55.240
Wei Liang, Wei Xiao, Wei Qu, Wei Duo,

21:55.320 --> 21:56.240
you stay behind.

21:56.320 --> 21:57.320
The rest, follow me.

21:57.400 --> 21:58.160
Yes.

21:58.240 --> 21:59.920
Thank you, generals.

22:11.800 --> 22:12.760
YUJUN

22:12.840 --> 22:14.600
Why am I stuck here?

22:14.680 --> 22:16.160
Couldn't you three stay instead?

22:16.240 --> 22:17.320
Quit your whining.

22:17.400 --> 22:18.720
Why can't it be you?

22:23.560 --> 22:24.480
Let's draw lots.

22:25.080 --> 22:26.480
No.

22:26.560 --> 22:27.840
I never win at that.

22:28.960 --> 22:30.880
You can only blame
your own bad luck for that.

22:48.720 --> 22:52.200
How dare they leave us
in this desolate area outside the city?

22:52.800 --> 22:56.560
I thought he'd treat Her Ladyship better
once we arrived in Yujun.

22:57.240 --> 23:00.320
He doesn't mean to shame us.

23:01.200 --> 23:04.040
But the memorial rites are being held for
three generations of the Wei family.

23:04.120 --> 23:05.680
Our presence would be improper.

23:05.760 --> 23:06.960
We should remain outside.

23:32.960 --> 23:37.120
LADY ZHU, WEI SHAO'S MOTHER

23:38.280 --> 23:42.760
SPIRIT TABLET OF THE LATE LORD WEI LUN

23:59.320 --> 24:00.600
ANCESTRAL VIRTUES ENDURE

24:19.280 --> 24:20.920
You're not even fully grown yet.

24:21.000 --> 24:23.320
How can you claim the clan leadership?

24:23.400 --> 24:24.880
You're shorter than the seat itself.

24:24.960 --> 24:26.400
What, are you gonna climb onto it?

24:26.480 --> 24:28.120
If a child ascends to leadership,

24:28.200 --> 24:29.440
I fear…

24:41.240 --> 24:45.200
WEI DIAN, PREFECT OF HANJUN

24:51.240 --> 24:54.880
How will a boy
who cries at the sight of blood

24:54.960 --> 24:56.280
lead armies in the future?

24:57.480 --> 24:59.760
When will Wei's blood feud be avenged?

24:59.840 --> 25:02.320
Exactly! This child cries
at the sight of blood.

25:02.400 --> 25:04.080
How will he ever take revenge?

25:04.160 --> 25:05.520
- My son…
- Indeed.

25:05.600 --> 25:06.840
What can he possibly achieve?

25:06.920 --> 25:08.400
When will our vengeance be settled?

25:16.560 --> 25:18.160
Lady Xu has arrived.

25:20.000 --> 25:21.200
Have you all had enough?

25:21.280 --> 25:23.320
Greetings, Lady Xu.

25:23.400 --> 25:24.480
Wei Shao,

25:24.560 --> 25:26.480
though not yet of age,

25:26.880 --> 25:29.200
shall inherit the clan leadership anyway.

25:29.760 --> 25:30.680
This…

25:30.760 --> 25:31.960
I

25:32.400 --> 25:33.680
pay my respects, my lord.

25:33.760 --> 25:35.680
I pay my respects, my lord.

25:37.800 --> 25:40.240
I, Zhonglin, swear to Heaven,

25:40.320 --> 25:43.840
I'll kill Li Su and the Qiao clan!

25:43.920 --> 25:53.000
Kill Li Su and the Qiao clan!

25:54.280 --> 25:55.760
Rise.

25:57.160 --> 25:58.080
Husband.

25:58.960 --> 25:59.960
Bogong.

26:00.320 --> 26:04.320
Why did you both leave me so soon?

26:04.880 --> 26:06.240
All these years,

26:07.440 --> 26:09.440
I've thought of nothing else

26:09.520 --> 26:11.920
but avenging you.

26:12.680 --> 26:13.680
One day,

26:13.760 --> 26:15.880
when I've taken revenge,

26:15.960 --> 26:18.720
I'll join you underground
so we can reunite.

26:20.000 --> 26:21.400
But today,

26:21.480 --> 26:23.000
Zhonglin

26:23.080 --> 26:25.560
is marrying our enemy's daughter.

26:27.320 --> 26:29.960
How can I ever face you

26:30.040 --> 26:32.160
with dignity now?

26:33.080 --> 26:35.320
I authorized their marriage.

26:36.200 --> 26:37.680
Zhonglin isn't to blame.

26:38.360 --> 26:40.400
A marriage is one thing,

26:41.440 --> 26:42.640
but Zhonglin,

26:43.360 --> 26:45.960
you didn't execute that Qiao traitor!

26:47.120 --> 26:50.160
You let him die of old age.

26:52.000 --> 26:53.040
Someone!

26:53.120 --> 26:56.280
Escort Lady Zhu to get some rest
before grief overwhelms her.

26:56.640 --> 26:57.840
Hold on!

27:00.680 --> 27:02.120
Lady Zhu speaks the truth.

27:02.200 --> 27:05.480
Lady Xu, why silence her now?

27:14.960 --> 27:16.000
Uncle,

27:16.880 --> 27:18.000
you're late again.

27:18.920 --> 27:21.560
Affairs in Hanjun kept me occupied.
That's why I was delayed.

27:22.000 --> 27:25.120
Surely the late Lord of Wei's spirit
wouldn't hold it against me.

27:25.680 --> 27:27.360
You, on the other hand,

27:27.440 --> 27:28.960
married our enemy's daughter.

27:29.760 --> 27:32.360
How could his spirit rest peacefully?

27:33.680 --> 27:35.000
Don't forget

27:35.080 --> 27:37.880
who once shouted,

27:37.960 --> 27:40.040
"Kill Li Su and the Qiao clan!"

27:40.120 --> 27:41.160
General,

27:41.680 --> 27:44.400
our lord has retaken Xindu
and slain Li Su.

27:44.480 --> 27:45.640
What of it?

27:45.720 --> 27:48.480
The Qiao clan's betrayal
was worse than Li Su's crimes.

27:51.000 --> 27:53.160
You were in Xindu back then.

27:53.240 --> 27:55.200
You saw the massacre yourself.

27:56.240 --> 27:57.400
Yet now,

27:57.480 --> 27:59.360
you welcome a Qiao into our home.

28:01.600 --> 28:02.960
How can the late lord

28:03.040 --> 28:03.960
rest in peace?

28:04.040 --> 28:06.600
Indeed.

28:10.960 --> 28:12.160
Look around you.

28:12.800 --> 28:16.360
Who here hasn't lost a father,
brother, or son?

28:18.320 --> 28:22.160
The Wei clan and the Qiao clan
are sworn enemies.

28:23.000 --> 28:24.320
Yet you…

28:24.400 --> 28:25.680
you married a Qiao woman.

28:26.400 --> 28:27.320
Fine.

28:28.240 --> 28:30.840
Let's see how you explain this
to our ancestors!

28:30.920 --> 28:31.800
Exactly.

28:34.680 --> 28:36.400
- Mr. Gongsun.
- Here.

28:49.920 --> 28:51.040
What is this?

28:51.520 --> 28:52.800
The seal of Panyi.

28:54.120 --> 28:56.960
Panyi is the gateway to Yanzhou.

28:57.040 --> 28:58.240
By marrying Lady Qiao,

28:58.320 --> 29:01.640
we took Panyi without a single battle.

29:02.520 --> 29:03.440
From now on,

29:03.520 --> 29:05.440
Yanzhou's gates lie open.

29:05.520 --> 29:07.200
Capturing Kangjun

29:07.280 --> 29:10.560
will be as easy as reaching into a bag.

29:11.960 --> 29:13.080
Pretty words.

29:13.960 --> 29:15.920
If you've taken Panyi,

29:16.000 --> 29:18.600
why not press the advantage
and seize Kangjun now?

29:23.400 --> 29:25.000
Uncle, if you must ask,

29:25.080 --> 29:26.280
then I have a question for you.

29:28.440 --> 29:30.600
As Prefect of Hanjun,

29:31.240 --> 29:32.960
after I took Xindu,

29:33.560 --> 29:37.280
I sent urgent dispatches
demanding reinforcements.

29:39.520 --> 29:41.560
Yet I waited for days.

29:42.840 --> 29:44.600
Why…

29:44.680 --> 29:45.920
did no aid arrive?

29:48.960 --> 29:50.760
You can't just accuse me.

29:50.840 --> 29:53.680
Everyone, I never received
a single letter.

29:53.760 --> 29:55.680
Otherwise, I would've sent help.

29:57.760 --> 29:58.640
Fine.

30:01.000 --> 30:02.480
I will get to the bottom of this.

30:10.680 --> 30:12.040
I marched my troops

30:12.640 --> 30:14.880
only to fulfill Grandfather's wish

30:15.760 --> 30:17.560
to restore the Yongning Canal

30:17.640 --> 30:19.400
and benefit the people.

30:20.400 --> 30:23.160
I've never forgotten the feud
between our two families.

30:24.160 --> 30:26.400
But if I could wait 14 years,

30:27.080 --> 30:30.200
I can surely wait ten more.

30:33.080 --> 30:35.960
YUJUN

30:40.040 --> 30:43.080
This is outrageous,
making us wait here in the pouring rain.

30:43.760 --> 30:47.520
They only barred you from entering,
my lady, not your maids.

30:47.600 --> 30:48.440
I'll confront them.

30:48.520 --> 30:49.800
Don't be rash.

30:52.000 --> 30:55.720
Are we just supposed to wait here forever?

30:55.800 --> 30:58.040
When has my lady
ever endured such humiliation?

31:01.080 --> 31:03.240
Since His Lordship still hasn't come,

31:03.320 --> 31:05.720
matters must still be unsettled.

31:05.800 --> 31:08.640
With clan relations still fragile,

31:08.720 --> 31:10.160
we must bear this slight.

31:10.240 --> 31:13.400
We knew marriage here would be difficult,

31:14.160 --> 31:15.840
just not this difficult.

31:19.840 --> 31:21.120
This won't do.

31:22.680 --> 31:25.200
Zao, let's hang the rain tarp.

31:26.160 --> 31:27.120
Go ahead.

31:27.840 --> 31:29.160
Take umbrellas.

31:34.400 --> 31:35.240
Pull harder!

31:35.320 --> 31:36.480
Lower it.

31:36.560 --> 31:37.400
Lower.

31:38.520 --> 31:40.240
Goodness. Let me help. Come on.

31:41.720 --> 31:42.680
Harder.

31:43.160 --> 31:44.360
Come on.

31:45.120 --> 31:47.240
Zao, assist him. He can't manage alone.

31:48.960 --> 31:50.320
Use what you have!

31:50.800 --> 31:52.000
Come on.

31:52.600 --> 31:54.520
One, two…

31:56.120 --> 31:57.160
Pull!

31:59.400 --> 32:00.720
Don't let go!

32:00.800 --> 32:03.240
One, two, three!

32:03.320 --> 32:05.080
This way! Over here!

32:05.160 --> 32:07.200
Duo, fetch the brazier.

32:07.280 --> 32:08.720
- Draw straws.
- Hurry!

32:08.800 --> 32:09.800
There.

32:09.880 --> 32:10.720
That's enough.

32:10.800 --> 32:13.280
Quick! Secure that stake tighter.

32:13.360 --> 32:15.120
That side. Move it over.

32:15.200 --> 32:16.640
- Hold it steady!
- Okay.

32:51.360 --> 32:52.920
No, I… I'll go ask outside.

33:06.560 --> 33:07.520
General Wei Liang,

33:08.640 --> 33:09.760
My lady is ill.

33:09.840 --> 33:11.120
Can't you let us in?

33:20.240 --> 33:21.360
Go back.

33:33.920 --> 33:35.000
How did it go?

34:04.120 --> 34:05.400
My lord.

34:29.880 --> 34:32.840
How is this different
from expelling us from Xindu?

34:32.920 --> 34:35.120
We'd have been better off in Panyi.

34:35.199 --> 34:36.880
At least closer to Kangjun.

34:39.920 --> 34:41.679
Her fever's getting worse.

34:41.760 --> 34:42.760
What do we do?

34:42.840 --> 34:45.199
Our luggage is soaked.
There are no dry covers left.

34:52.440 --> 34:53.480
You go that way.

34:53.560 --> 34:54.960
- You two, come with me.
- Yes.

34:56.520 --> 34:58.120
Are you here to escort us into the city?

34:58.200 --> 34:59.960
We've been ordered to take you to Yanzhou.

35:00.040 --> 35:01.000
Yanzhou?

35:01.080 --> 35:02.120
Yes.

35:05.880 --> 35:08.480
Nonsense! On whose orders?

35:09.120 --> 35:11.280
My lady is married to the Lord of Wei.

35:11.360 --> 35:13.760
She's the Lady of Wei now!

35:13.840 --> 35:15.280
Not anymore.

35:15.800 --> 35:16.560
LETTER OF DIVORCE

35:16.640 --> 35:17.600
Faster!

35:17.680 --> 35:18.720
Letter of Divorce?

35:19.280 --> 35:20.360
Hey!

35:21.120 --> 35:22.640
- Don't move!
- Get down!

35:22.720 --> 35:24.400
- Down, now!
- What are you doing?

35:24.480 --> 35:26.120
- On your knees! Stay down!
- What for?

35:26.200 --> 35:27.280
Kneel!

35:27.360 --> 35:30.560
Since our lord married Lady Wei in Panyi,
he wouldn't banish her now.

35:30.640 --> 35:31.480
Something's wrong here.

35:31.560 --> 35:32.840
Enough nonsense! Get down!

35:32.920 --> 35:34.360
What are you doing?

35:34.440 --> 35:36.040
Don't touch our belongings!

35:36.120 --> 35:37.160
You guard the carriage.

35:37.240 --> 35:39.640
Wei Liang, enter the city at once
and seek confirmation.

35:39.720 --> 35:41.760
- Get down!
- What's going on?

35:43.000 --> 35:44.200
My lord,

35:44.280 --> 35:46.520
General Wei Liang requests an audience
outside the city.

35:46.840 --> 35:48.120
Why is Wei Liang outside?

35:48.200 --> 35:49.120
Have you forgotten?

35:49.200 --> 35:50.880
He's been outside for days
attending Lady Wei.

35:50.960 --> 35:51.760
TAN, ATTENDANT

35:52.200 --> 35:56.400
With the recent storms,
she's been ill for some time.

35:57.240 --> 35:59.040
The rites concluded two days ago.

35:59.120 --> 36:00.240
Why wasn't she summoned inside?

36:00.800 --> 36:02.160
I don't know.

36:04.040 --> 36:05.320
Shao.

36:05.400 --> 36:07.240
I have urgent matters to report.

36:07.320 --> 36:09.000
The situation is grave and sudden.

36:09.080 --> 36:10.680
Forgive my abruptness.

36:10.760 --> 36:12.200
I beg your pardon.

36:12.680 --> 36:13.880
Speak.

36:13.960 --> 36:14.880
Days ago,

36:14.960 --> 36:18.160
you ordered me
to escort Lady Qiao into the city.

36:18.240 --> 36:20.000
All was prepared,

36:20.080 --> 36:22.480
but Aunt had other plans.

36:23.360 --> 36:24.920
Aunt acts out of motherly love.

36:25.000 --> 36:27.560
Everything she does is for your sake.

36:28.000 --> 36:30.000
So, I followed her instructions.

36:30.480 --> 36:32.000
But afterward,

36:32.080 --> 36:35.160
I feared that
this might not align with your wishes.

36:35.240 --> 36:37.120
So I came to tell you

36:37.200 --> 36:38.400
for my own peace of mind.

36:38.480 --> 36:39.640
What are you trying to say?

36:41.920 --> 36:46.640
Aunt feared Lady Qiao
would bewitch and endanger you,

36:46.720 --> 36:50.240
so she sent someone to deliver
a Letter of Divorce.

36:51.200 --> 36:54.200
- What?
- I beg you, Shao, don't blame Aunt.

36:54.280 --> 36:55.320
This is madness!

36:56.880 --> 36:58.920
YUJUN

37:02.520 --> 37:03.680
What are you doing?

37:03.760 --> 37:05.040
- Stop!
- Move aside!

37:05.680 --> 37:06.800
Why?

37:06.880 --> 37:08.600
Don't pull it out!

37:08.680 --> 37:09.880
Step back!

37:11.760 --> 37:12.640
It's out.

37:16.560 --> 37:18.560
- No, don't pull it out!
- It's been pulled out. Ready.

37:18.640 --> 37:20.400
- Leave them!
- Get away!

37:21.560 --> 37:22.520
My lady!

37:22.600 --> 37:25.880
Speak to me, please.

37:25.960 --> 37:27.920
Pull harder!

37:28.280 --> 37:30.880
General, please. Please.

37:31.880 --> 37:33.520
My lady is ill.

37:34.040 --> 37:35.400
General…

37:35.480 --> 37:36.960
- General, you…
- Go away!

37:38.240 --> 37:40.120
Hurry! Pull harder!

37:41.520 --> 37:42.560
My lady.

37:46.120 --> 37:47.280
Generals.

37:53.040 --> 37:54.360
I beg you,

37:54.440 --> 37:57.120
please ask His Lordship again.

37:57.200 --> 37:59.760
There must be some mistake.

37:59.840 --> 38:02.760
He wouldn't cast her out like this.

38:04.640 --> 38:06.840
- I implore you.
- Stop this. Please, get up.

38:07.360 --> 38:09.160
I'm begging you.

38:11.440 --> 38:12.480
Enough. Enough.

38:12.560 --> 38:14.160
You've always scowled at us.

38:14.240 --> 38:15.440
Why act like this now?

38:15.920 --> 38:17.760
Wei Liang went to inform His Lordship.

38:17.840 --> 38:19.080
No response yet.

38:19.160 --> 38:20.480
His Lordship's mind seems set.

38:21.120 --> 38:22.360
How I treated you before…

38:22.440 --> 38:24.240
That's all my fault.

38:24.840 --> 38:26.720
Punish me however you want.

38:27.760 --> 38:30.000
But my lady has never harmed you.

38:31.080 --> 38:32.760
She was already injured.

38:33.600 --> 38:35.720
Now she's burning with fever.

38:35.800 --> 38:37.480
If she's jostled on the road back,

38:38.400 --> 38:40.080
she'll die.

38:40.640 --> 38:42.040
I beg you.

38:42.440 --> 38:44.360
Back in Panyi,

38:44.440 --> 38:48.160
she burned her own arm
just to help you all,

38:48.240 --> 38:49.720
and it's still not healed.

38:51.120 --> 38:53.440
How can you be so heartless?

38:54.400 --> 38:56.800
Even if His Lordship is determined
to cast her out,

38:57.440 --> 38:59.160
he shouldn't take her life.

38:59.240 --> 39:00.800
- Hurry.
- Move the carriage.

39:02.600 --> 39:03.680
Move, now!

39:07.400 --> 39:09.320
Hey!

39:09.680 --> 39:11.040
No!

39:11.120 --> 39:12.880
No! Hey!

39:12.960 --> 39:14.320
No, stop!

39:14.400 --> 39:15.440
Step back!

39:16.080 --> 39:17.240
Quick, push it through.

39:17.760 --> 39:18.720
Don't be afraid.

39:18.800 --> 39:21.000
Stop pushing. They can't leave.

39:22.960 --> 39:23.880
What do we do?

39:23.960 --> 39:25.600
At worst, we'll get beaten
with the military rod.

39:25.680 --> 39:27.600
For something this serious,
it'll be 40 blows at least.

39:27.680 --> 39:28.360
But…

39:28.440 --> 39:30.120
- Don't! Stop pushing!
- Go away!

39:30.200 --> 39:31.520
Don't be afraid.

39:31.600 --> 39:33.760
I'm here.

39:33.840 --> 39:35.640
Stop! It's not allowed!

39:36.280 --> 39:37.520
Get lost!

39:38.840 --> 39:39.960
Block the carriage first!

40:29.480 --> 40:30.520
My lord.

40:30.600 --> 40:31.640
Who sent you here?

40:31.720 --> 40:32.800
It… it was Lady Zhu.

40:32.880 --> 40:34.360
- Get lost!
- Yes, my lord.

40:38.880 --> 40:39.680
My lord.

40:40.160 --> 40:42.240
My lady is burning with fever.

40:42.320 --> 40:44.480
Please, save her.

40:44.560 --> 40:46.160
I beg you, my lord.
